#
# The following format is used for TASKs and ITEMS:
#
# ITEM P<N> S<N> "Item's description"
#     TASK "Task's description"
#     TASK "Task's description"
#
# P<N> - <N> is the priority from 1 (lowest) to 10 (highest)
# S<N> - <N> is the size as Fibonacci number 1 (easiest), 2, 3, 5, 8 or 13 (most difficult)
#
# Use P0 and/or S99 if the priority and/or the size has/have not yet decided
#

